# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the prefill SDPA programme's oneq jobs (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a
# throwaway commit of tp4/fusion-1 (a branch that carries optimisation/ttnn-op/sdpa_prefill_oneq) and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. ONE TAG AT A TIME; wait for the run to
# finish; never cancel a running card job. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. A placeholder in @...@ is filled in by whoever drives the
# window (@SERVED_IMAGE@: the served image's reference; @K64J_OQ_GRAFT_DIR@ and @K64J_OQ_TTNNCPP_SHA256@: the K64j-OQ graft directory and its binary's digest, the K64J_OQ_TTNNCPP_SHA256 line of
# L1). C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the window's own image: the ONE fusion image, built by OQ-B0 (the fusion pack's B0 with C2_BAKE_GRAFT=K64j-OQ) from the pushed branch head
# (sed -i 's/tp4-fusion-1/<tag>/' *.env). ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the read rules and the minutes.
# A1 (EXACTNESS, four cards): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-all-oneq-audit = the combined audited arm plus QWEN_FAST_SDPA_PF_ONEQ=1 and QWEN_FAST_SDPA_PF_ONEQ_AUDIT=1. The boot runs every lever of the combination with its audit AND the oneq
# prefill SDPA with its own audit (the first 8 engaged calls and then every 24th also run the chain's program on the same inputs and compare the two outputs bit for bit on every chip). The smoke is the
# solo prefill ladder (every rung prefills at 2048 rows, so oneq engages at every chunk start) and the steady eight-user window (the combined levers' decode audits). READ: c2_smoke_check clean under every
# lever's rule at once; '[PINDIAG] sdpa prefill oneq engaged' and an '[PINDIAG] sdpa prefill oneq audit n=.. exact=True' line, NO 'fell back' and no 'audit mismatch' line, no stall, every answer complete.
# ANY mismatch is NO-GO for the lever: stop and read the first mismatch line (it names the layer and the chip); T1-T4 do not run. Duration (estimate): boot 12 minutes, the ladder 6 (the audit doubles only
# the sampled calls), the steady window 25; 60 minutes in all.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-all-oneq-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,prefill_ladder_solo,concurrent8_steady
C2_TELEMETRY=1
C2_BOX_MINUTES=80
